OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening. However,
OL,7,Fcloud will be increasing from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest, which will bring some
OL,9,Foutbreaks of patchy light rain
OL,10,Fovernight. Another band of mostly
OL,11,Flight rain will arrive by dawn.
OL,12,FBreezy. Generally mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,15,Fmostly light rain will be moving
OL,16,Fsoutheastwards across all parts during
OL,17,Fthe morning, clearing shortly after
OL,18,Fmidday. Largely dry with sunny spells
OL,19,Fin the afternoon. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
