OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Funsettled to start the period with
OL,7,Ffurther light rain and blustery winds
OL,8,Fthrough Friday and into Saturday.
OL,9,FTurning drier and brighter on Sunday.
OL,10,FTemperatures becoming above average.
